{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小池美波、鈴本美愉、長沢菜々香が掲載されているBOMBが発売されました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダルメシアン柄のスカートをみんなで、着用しています。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3RXXY3D5XJ99CNB0D267D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1周年=ワン\nということで、犬に変身!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3RZCVZ99QEWY2KCRBKBA8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"首輪風のチョーカーもみんなでしています!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、猫っぽい性格のメンバーが多いねと、インタビューのときに話になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たしかに!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな自由奔放です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3S16Q0JTH0RW9Z5N76NX5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n途中で、みゆと私のカチューシャを交換しました。\nたしかにこっちのほうがしっくりきていた気がします!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3S36P0CWS49HR17XMT2GP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n犬になりきるのが、楽しかったです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキもとっても美味しかったです!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3S4RWDGMRDEPRJRHHJ8KT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}